            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Imanewme"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don’t have a grill so I roasted the eggplant, but otherwise followed the recipe. Fabulous. It was easy to make, the eggplant wasn’t bitter at all, and I will be making it again.",
