            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pizzacake"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Followed recipe except for eggplant preparation. I sliced it thick and grilled over gas heat. I think this method worked fine. I needed a larger eggplant but, it was still good. I just made this again for 2nd time in 3 days. It is so good. I had more eggplant this time. If you love the individual ingredients, give this a try. You won't be disappointed.",
